From: TDVP <tdvp@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] serialize PAM attempts and require authenticated Wayland unlock

Pair with the TDVP synchronous auth.c replacement installed by the package.
Keep GTK calls on the main thread, do not retain window pointers across PAM,
clear copied secrets, and fail closed on unauthenticated application shutdown.
Show the current user and reduce margins for the board's landscape screen.

Upstream: Not submitted (TDVP-specific authentication backend integration)

diff --git a/include/gtklock.h b/include/gtklock.h
index 64c2f72..47290f1 100644
--- a/include/gtklock.h
+++ b/include/gtklock.h
@@ -21,6 +21,8 @@ struct GtkLock {
 
 	struct Window *focused_window;
 	gboolean hidden;
+	/* Only successful PAM authentication may send Wayland unlock. */
+	gboolean authenticated;
 	guint idle_timeout;
 
 	guint draw_time_source;
